Z||000000||Chris Schaefer||01-02-2001||09:54 PM||||The Fiero Owners Club of New England (FOCONE) has just confirmed the date for our annual summer show.  The date of the show is June 15 - 16, 2001.  The location is Old Orchard Beach, ME.  More information will be available soon.  <P>There will be a registration form available for anyone who wishes to attend.  The registration form will be ready for release no later than the end of January.  There will be two registration fees.  One fee will be for FOCONE members and another for nonmembers.<P>If you wish to become a member of our club, please reply with your mailing address and I will gladly send you our membership application form.<P>Thank you.||||reg||10
